  "content": "\n\n<h1>Default Dark Create</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"amongstreality на Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/amongstreality/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"amongstreality на CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"amongstreality на Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"amongstreality на Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p>\n<p>Этот пакет ресурсов добавляет поддержку тёмного режима в <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>, используя цветовую палитру из <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdefault-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Default Dark Mode</a>.</p>\n<h2>Совместимость</h2>\n<p>Default Dark Create создан для версии 6.0.6 мода Create. Может работать некорректно с более старыми версиями Create.</p>\n<h2>Поддержать меня и мои проекты можно здесь</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Купить мне кофе\"></a></p>",
